``?flow=EXPORT&partner=DE``; several values are comma-separated. Dimensions
that are not filtered fall back to the configured defaults (usually the
"total" code) so that values are never double counted.

Data that was never loaded (see the ``_loaded_slice`` registry written by the
loader) is fetched live from the SDMX source on first use, stored, and flagged
``fetched_live``; when that is impossible (offline), responses say
``loaded: false`` instead of presenting missing data as zero.
